00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.960
Mark: Honey, it's fine, it's okay, it's all under control!

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:32.960
Bob: And you're sprinting away from me full-speed right now. What does this say about our relationship?

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:36.860
Mark: I- Just- You gotta get CARDIO in whenever you CAN, KAREN!

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:38.900
Mark: YOU GOTTA DO IT, IT'S IMPORTANT!

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:40.060
