00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:51.520
Bob: DON'T change the subject!

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:54.100
Mark: Hey, alright, you wanna see me eat?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.840
Mark: THERE. DONE. I ATE.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.040
